data: {"id": "cb221e7be81d4f01-thinking-parallel_evidence-1988", "run_id": "cb221e7be81d4f01", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据汇总与结论\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v10/workload`\n- **UID**: `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`\n- **Node**: `node2`, **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.19`\n- **容器**: `app`, **镜像**: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **重启次数**: 7\n\n### 支持\"Application error or misconfiguration causing exit\"的证据\n\n1. **容器退出原因**: 7 次重启，`Last State: Terminated, Reason=Error, Exit Code=78`\n2. **退出前日志 (kubectl_previous_logs)**: `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`\n3. **当前日志 (kubect", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789140782751, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

